1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 12=

2
00:01:09,980 --> 00:01:10,980
Thank you, everyone,

3
00:01:11,180 --> 00:01:12,500
for coming here

4
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:13,460
on this solemn day.

5
00:01:13,660 --> 00:01:14,580
Mei Xiaozhu

6
00:01:15,020 --> 00:01:16,540
was the top student
at Mintong Middle School

7
00:01:17,020 --> 00:01:19,500
and a recipient
of the Cishan Foundation scholarship.

8
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:21,420
She was in the prime of her youth,

9
00:01:21,660 --> 00:01:23,420
yet before
she could fulfill her ambitions,

10
00:01:23,420 --> 00:01:24,820
she left us far too soon.

11
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:26,860
It is truly a great loss.

12
00:01:28,660 --> 00:01:29,620
As for Xiaozhu's death,

13
00:01:30,180 --> 00:01:32,580
I'm sure
everyone here has heard about it.

14
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:35,740
But no matter how
the newspapers have smeared her

15
00:01:35,900 --> 00:01:36,820
and tarnished her reputation,

16
00:01:37,380 --> 00:01:39,820
no matter how people
have speculated about her

17
00:01:39,860 --> 00:01:40,780
or judged her,

18
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:41,820
her death

19
00:01:42,420 --> 00:01:44,300
was a tragic accident.

20
00:01:44,300 --> 00:01:45,020
That's not true.

21
00:01:45,020 --> 00:01:46,060
You're wrong.

22
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:50,460
Yiyi.

23
00:01:50,460 --> 00:01:50,980
Zhao!

24
00:01:50,980 --> 00:01:51,460
Come any closer,

25
00:01:51,460 --> 00:01:52,460
and I'll kill her.

26
00:02:00,820 --> 00:02:01,620
Tell them!

27
00:02:01,980 --> 00:02:02,500
It was me.

28
00:02:03,300 --> 00:02:04,620
I caused Xiaozhu's death.

29
00:02:04,620 --> 00:02:05,420
What did you say?

30
00:02:05,620 --> 00:02:06,420
Don't do anything rash.

31
00:02:06,420 --> 00:02:08,060
I was the one who took her to Kaimeili.

32
00:02:08,060 --> 00:02:10,060
But I only wanted
to help her make connections.

33
00:02:10,060 --> 00:02:11,620
Didn't she want to go to France?

34
00:02:11,620 --> 00:02:13,740
I wanted to help
create opportunities for her.

35
00:02:13,980 --> 00:02:15,100
But I never expected...

36
00:02:15,820 --> 00:02:16,580
I never thought...

37
00:02:16,580 --> 00:02:17,340
She would actually...

38
00:02:17,460 --> 00:02:18,220
You're lying!

39
00:02:18,220 --> 00:02:19,020
I'm not!

40
00:02:19,260 --> 00:02:20,780
You wanted to please Lv Mengde,

41
00:02:20,780 --> 00:02:22,380
so you tricked
her into attending a dance at Kaimeili.

42
00:02:22,620 --> 00:02:24,620
You planned
to offer her to the other bosses.

43
00:02:24,980 --> 00:02:26,020
But what you didn't expect

44
00:02:26,020 --> 00:02:27,180
was that Xiaozhu wasn't like you.

45
00:02:27,180 --> 00:02:28,780
She would never sell herself
for personal gain.

46
00:02:28,780 --> 00:02:29,620
That's not what happened!

47
00:02:29,620 --> 00:02:30,920
That's not how it happened at all!

48
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:31,320
Yiyi.

49
00:02:31,340 --> 00:02:32,480
She was just insatiably greedy!

50
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:33,260
She acted one way to my face

51
00:02:33,260 --> 00:02:34,260
and another behind my back.

52
00:02:34,380 --> 00:02:35,340
Right in front of me,

53
00:02:35,540 --> 00:02:36,420
she said Mengde was no good

54
00:02:36,420 --> 00:02:37,580
and forced me to break up with him.

55
00:02:37,860 --> 00:02:39,380
Then she turned around
and got involved with him.

56
00:02:39,860 --> 00:02:40,900
She called me naive

57
00:02:41,020 --> 00:02:41,980
and foolish.

58
00:02:42,100 --> 00:02:43,900
But she was greedier than anyone!

59
00:02:43,900 --> 00:02:44,180
You...

60
00:02:44,180 --> 00:02:45,020
You really are naive

61
00:02:45,020 --> 00:02:45,820
and foolish!

62
00:02:46,380 --> 00:02:47,220
Xiaozhu borrowed money for you

63
00:02:47,220 --> 00:02:48,420
and got herself
into terrible trouble for you.

64
00:02:48,420 --> 00:02:49,180
Everything that happened

65
00:02:49,180 --> 00:02:50,220
was because of you!

66
00:02:50,500 --> 00:02:51,300
Yiyi!

67
00:03:02,180 --> 00:03:02,980
Lv Mengde!

68
00:03:05,580 --> 00:03:06,660
Boss Ren! Mr. Yoshida!

69
00:03:06,860 --> 00:03:07,940
Over here! Hurry!

70
00:03:08,220 --> 00:03:08,980
Boss!

71
00:03:08,980 --> 00:03:10,180
All the bosses are here!

72
00:03:10,180 --> 00:03:11,500
The dead can't speak for themselves.

73
00:03:15,220 --> 00:03:16,020
Yiyi.

74
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:17,100
Wait!

75
00:03:17,220 --> 00:03:18,020
What?

76
00:03:22,700 --> 00:03:24,940
Miss Mei, why are you hiding?

77
00:03:25,620 --> 00:03:26,340
What are you going to do?

78
00:03:26,660 --> 00:03:28,140
Didn't you want
to demand justice at the funeral?

79
00:03:28,420 --> 00:03:29,860
Come out and confront me!

80
00:03:30,060 --> 00:03:31,220
Didn't you say you had evidence?

81
00:03:31,500 --> 00:03:32,100
Here! Right here!

82
00:03:33,180 --> 00:03:35,180
Don't you want to avenge your sister?

83
00:03:35,180 --> 00:03:35,620
Ding Zhao!

84
00:03:35,980 --> 00:03:37,540
Don't you want to kill me too?

85
00:03:38,300 --> 00:03:39,100
Come on out!

86
00:03:44,420 --> 00:03:45,820
Boss, watch out!

87
00:03:49,260 --> 00:03:51,580
Xiaozhu, I'm sorry.

88
00:03:54,140 --> 00:03:54,940
Miss Mei!

89
00:04:02,780 --> 00:04:03,380
Get them!

90
00:04:05,140 --> 00:04:05,660
Hurry, go!

91
00:04:05,660 --> 00:04:07,580
Mengde!

92
00:04:07,580 --> 00:04:08,380
Ding Yiyi!

93
00:04:08,460 --> 00:04:10,380
I'll take Miss Ding
home and look after her.

94
00:04:10,380 --> 00:04:11,180
Don't worry.

95
00:04:12,940 --> 00:04:14,260
Bring that woman out to me.

96
00:04:14,460 --> 00:04:15,500
Kill everyone else.

97
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:16,000
Jiusheng.

98
00:04:18,140 --> 00:04:18,940
Let's go!

99
00:04:20,420 --> 00:04:21,220
Jiusheng!

100
00:04:32,580 --> 00:04:33,180
Over here.

101
00:04:34,220 --> 00:04:35,260
Let's hide here for now.

102
00:04:40,780 --> 00:04:41,780
She's badly wounded.

103
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:43,820
The bullet struck her lung.

104
00:04:43,820 --> 00:04:44,580
She's lost too much blood.

105
00:04:44,580 --> 00:04:45,700
We need
to get her to a hospital immediately.

106
00:04:46,220 --> 00:04:46,740
Hurry!

107
00:04:46,740 --> 00:04:47,540
Search over there!

108
00:04:47,820 --> 00:04:48,780
We can't stay here.

109
00:04:49,180 --> 00:04:50,180
If they find us,

110
00:04:50,180 --> 00:04:51,020
she won't stand a chance.

111
00:04:51,020 --> 00:04:51,740
I'll get the car.

112
00:04:51,740 --> 00:04:52,660
Wait here for me.

113
00:04:53,140 --> 00:04:53,940
Miss Mei.

114
00:04:54,340 --> 00:04:55,180
Please be careful.

115
00:05:05,740 --> 00:05:06,660
It really was him.

116
00:05:07,060 --> 00:05:07,860
Kuang Yijie.

117
00:05:09,660 --> 00:05:10,580
Saving him comes first.

118
00:05:10,780 --> 00:05:11,820
If he dies,

119
00:05:11,820 --> 00:05:12,660
we'll have an even bigger problem.

120
00:05:15,980 --> 00:05:16,780
This scar...

121
00:05:17,180 --> 00:05:17,980
What about it?

122
00:05:18,140 --> 00:05:19,380
Xiaozhu had an identical one,

123
00:05:20,180 --> 00:05:21,260
but hers was on the right side.

124
00:05:24,180 --> 00:05:24,980
Don't you think

125
00:05:25,460 --> 00:05:26,860
he looks like Xiaozhu?

126
00:05:28,940 --> 00:05:30,220
You sure ran fast.

127
00:05:30,580 --> 00:05:31,380
Lv Mengde!

128
00:05:32,100 --> 00:05:32,900
Don't move!

129
00:05:34,580 --> 00:05:35,780
Why is he here?

130
00:05:37,980 --> 00:05:39,220
No wonder we couldn't find him.

131
00:05:40,620 --> 00:05:41,340
Hand him over.

132
00:05:41,340 --> 00:05:42,100
Not a chance.

133
00:05:43,020 --> 00:05:43,860
He's my nephew.

134
00:05:43,860 --> 00:05:44,820
Do you think I'd hurt him?

135
00:05:44,820 --> 00:05:45,580
You're also the one

136
00:05:45,580 --> 00:05:46,180
who shot him.

137
00:05:46,180 --> 00:05:47,020
Dressed like that,

138
00:05:47,020 --> 00:05:48,140
how was anyone
supposed to recognize him?

139
00:05:51,980 --> 00:05:52,780
Ding Zhao.

140
00:05:54,220 --> 00:05:55,860
Why are you keeping quiet?

141
00:05:55,980 --> 00:05:56,780
Have you forgotten?

142
00:05:56,780 --> 00:05:58,180
A thousand yuan in tribute money.

143
00:05:58,180 --> 00:05:59,780
You promised to find him.

144
00:05:59,780 --> 00:06:01,380
Once you found him,
you were supposed to hand him over.

145
00:06:01,380 --> 00:06:02,780
If you'd handed him over sooner,

146
00:06:02,780 --> 00:06:03,980
he wouldn't have been hurt.

147
00:06:03,980 --> 00:06:05,660
None of this would have happened!

148
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:06,620
It's your fault!

149
00:06:06,620 --> 00:06:07,660
It's all your fault!

150
00:06:12,220 --> 00:06:13,020
I promise you.

151
00:06:13,020 --> 00:06:13,740
No!

152
00:06:13,740 --> 00:06:14,660
Absolutely not!

153
00:06:14,740 --> 00:06:16,100
If we don't hand Kuang Yijie over,

154
00:06:16,380 --> 00:06:17,660
none of us will get out of here.

155
00:06:18,660 --> 00:06:19,460
Lv Mengde.

156
00:06:20,140 --> 00:06:21,620
But you must agree to one condition.

157
00:06:22,220 --> 00:06:24,020
Take him to the hospital immediately.

158
00:06:24,020 --> 00:06:24,780
Obviously!

159
00:06:25,740 --> 00:06:26,540
Go away!

160
00:06:28,980 --> 00:06:29,780
Get lost!

161
00:06:44,740 --> 00:06:45,580
The car is here.

162
00:06:45,580 --> 00:06:46,380
Let's go.

163
00:06:48,140 --> 00:06:48,980
Lv Mengde?

164
00:06:49,620 --> 00:06:50,820
Take Kuang Yijie to the hospital.

165
00:07:03,340 --> 00:07:05,620
Yijie! Kuang Yijie!

166
00:07:07,580 --> 00:07:09,460
Have you seen a sixteen-year-old boy?

167
00:07:09,580 --> 00:07:11,140
Everyone's already run off.
There's no one left.

168
00:07:15,660 --> 00:07:16,500
What should we do with this?

169
00:07:16,980 --> 00:07:17,940
Take it outside and throw it away.

170
00:07:18,180 --> 00:07:19,620
Please take her to the Jinpeng Mansion.

171
00:07:19,620 --> 00:07:20,860
Are you her family?

172
00:07:31,700 --> 00:07:32,500
Boss Ren.

173
00:07:33,180 --> 00:07:33,980
Mengde...

174
00:07:33,980 --> 00:07:36,300
How could he possibly kill anyone?

175
00:07:36,790 --> 00:07:37,820
I'm afraid...

176
00:07:38,300 --> 00:07:40,460
There must be some misunderstanding.

177
00:07:40,790 --> 00:07:42,020
Whether it's a misunderstanding

178
00:07:42,540 --> 00:07:44,020
or he's fled to escape punishment,

179
00:07:44,940 --> 00:07:46,140
we'll know once you bring him here

180
00:07:46,180 --> 00:07:47,420
and let us question him.

181
00:07:47,420 --> 00:07:48,540
But right now,

182
00:07:48,540 --> 00:07:50,380
I don't even know where he's gone.

183
00:07:59,380 --> 00:08:03,580
These clothes were found
in a side room of the church.

184
00:08:04,220 --> 00:08:05,300
Whether he's dead or alive,

185
00:08:05,740 --> 00:08:07,820
I'd like an explanation, Boss Kuang.

186
00:08:26,900 --> 00:08:27,660
(Xiaozhu.)

187
00:08:27,660 --> 00:08:28,780
(Will you come home with me?)

188
00:08:29,420 --> 00:08:30,180
I can ask my grandfather

189
00:08:30,180 --> 00:08:31,380
to send you to study in France.

190
00:08:31,380 --> 00:08:32,460
What do I care about the Kuang family?

191
00:08:32,580 --> 00:08:33,820
I'm not interested in them at all.

192
00:08:34,420 --> 00:08:35,420
I'm sorry, Xiaozhu.

193
00:08:35,620 --> 00:08:36,860
I didn't think it through.

194
00:08:36,940 --> 00:08:38,260
But I never meant to hurt you.

195
00:08:38,260 --> 00:08:39,660
Please stay out of my life.

196
00:08:43,540 --> 00:08:44,620
Why, Xiaozhu?

197
00:08:44,860 --> 00:08:45,900
I don't want anything

198
00:08:45,900 --> 00:08:47,220
to do with the Kuang family anymore.

199
00:08:47,980 --> 00:08:49,140
No matter what you say,

200
00:08:50,060 --> 00:08:51,860
I won't go to the Kuang residence
for your birthday.

201
00:08:52,020 --> 00:08:53,820
Xiaozhu!

202
00:09:08,180 --> 00:09:09,700
Xiaozhu.

203
00:09:11,380 --> 00:09:12,940
Xiaozhu.

204
00:09:22,460 --> 00:09:23,500
When did you

205
00:09:23,500 --> 00:09:25,420
realize Kuang Yijie was the woman?

206
00:09:27,940 --> 00:09:28,820
Before the funeral.

207
00:09:29,980 --> 00:09:31,700
He dressed as a woman

208
00:09:32,260 --> 00:09:33,260
and gave me a stack of reports

209
00:09:33,260 --> 00:09:35,180
about other missing women.

210
00:09:36,220 --> 00:09:38,940
Together with the information
he'd left at the hot water shop,

211
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:41,060
I knew

212
00:09:41,420 --> 00:09:43,920
(Mei Xiaozhu, Dong Zhenglun)
the woman was a friend, not an enemy.

213
00:09:45,140 --> 00:09:45,940
Later,

214
00:09:47,020 --> 00:09:48,980
I noticed the footprints he'd left behind

215
00:09:49,460 --> 00:09:50,500
matched the size

216
00:09:50,500 --> 00:09:52,780
of the leather shoes
I'd had made for Yijie.

217
00:09:53,180 --> 00:09:54,180
Then, at the Cishan Foundation,

218
00:09:54,180 --> 00:09:56,340
I saw a photo
of the two of them together.

219
00:09:57,620 --> 00:10:00,900
Yijie looked very fond
of Xiaozhu in that photo.

220
00:10:02,220 --> 00:10:03,660
That was when I realized

221
00:10:04,780 --> 00:10:05,980
he'd had an ulterior motive

222
00:10:06,060 --> 00:10:08,860
for what he said to me at Kaimeili.

223
00:10:09,940 --> 00:10:11,420
That's when I began to suspect him.

224
00:10:22,940 --> 00:10:24,860
This is probably why

225
00:10:24,860 --> 00:10:26,500
they got caught up
in this whole incident.

226
00:10:29,460 --> 00:10:30,660
This is Xiaozhu's handwriting.

227
00:10:31,380 --> 00:10:32,540
Where did you find it?

228
00:10:36,980 --> 00:10:38,020
At the Sanshi Club.

229
00:10:38,620 --> 00:10:40,380
Where the Kuang family
was preparing for the Sanxun Gathering.

230
00:10:40,380 --> 00:10:41,140
Young Master.

231
00:10:41,740 --> 00:10:42,180
Young Master.

232
00:10:42,180 --> 00:10:42,620
It's so late.

233
00:10:42,620 --> 00:10:43,620
What brings you here?

234
00:10:43,780 --> 00:10:44,700
I came to get something.

235
00:10:44,740 --> 00:10:45,820
Carry on with your meal and drinks.

236
00:10:45,980 --> 00:10:46,250
All right.

237
00:10:47,300 --> 00:10:48,060
Everyone,

238
00:10:48,060 --> 00:10:48,690
let's get back to eating.

239
00:10:48,690 --> 00:10:49,050
All right.

240
00:10:52,180 --> 00:10:53,980
I'd always suspected
something was wrong with Kuang Yijie,

241
00:10:54,580 --> 00:10:56,380
both at Kaimeili

242
00:10:56,820 --> 00:10:58,940
and when he took Yiyi to see a doctor.

243
00:10:59,420 --> 00:11:00,940
So I kept a closer eye on him

244
00:11:01,940 --> 00:11:03,300
to find out what he was really up to.

245
00:11:28,040 --> 00:11:30,680
(And the ones with their tails raised.)

246
00:11:37,180 --> 00:11:38,300
He and Xiaozhu,

247
00:11:38,860 --> 00:11:40,060
and your sister too.

248
00:11:41,820 --> 00:11:43,340
I should've realized sooner.

249
00:11:43,780 --> 00:11:45,180
Don't worry, Miss Mei.

250
00:11:45,780 --> 00:11:46,780
As for what happened to Yiyi,

251
00:11:46,780 --> 00:11:48,060
I'll get to the bottom of it

252
00:11:48,180 --> 00:11:49,420
and give you an explanation.

253
00:11:53,780 --> 00:11:55,780
Let's wait until Yijie wakes up.

254
00:12:11,540 --> 00:12:12,100
Here.

255
00:12:18,140 --> 00:12:18,940
Thank you.

256
00:12:25,040 --> 00:12:27,080
(Operating Room)

257
00:12:29,580 --> 00:12:30,380
How is he?

258
00:12:30,620 --> 00:12:31,980
He's alive for now.

259
00:12:31,980 --> 00:12:33,140
But he's lost too much blood.

260
00:12:33,180 --> 00:12:34,620
We don't know when he'll wake up.

261
00:12:34,620 --> 00:12:36,100
We need to notify his family.

262
00:12:38,220 --> 00:12:39,060
I'll notify them.

263
00:12:39,260 --> 00:12:40,340
But we'll need a different explanation.

264
00:12:40,740 --> 00:12:41,820
No one can know

265
00:12:41,940 --> 00:12:43,300
he was shot at the funeral.

266
00:12:43,660 --> 00:12:44,700
We don't want any more trouble.

267
00:12:45,220 --> 00:12:46,180
I'd better go.

268
00:12:46,580 --> 00:12:47,540
Yiyi is at the Kuang residence.

269
00:12:47,780 --> 00:12:48,740
I still need to pick her up.

270
00:12:49,140 --> 00:12:50,740
Yiyi? Ding Yiyi?

271
00:12:51,140 --> 00:12:51,660
Yes.

272
00:12:52,940 --> 00:12:53,460
You...

273
00:12:54,060 --> 00:12:55,380
You're Dr. Bai?

274
00:12:55,500 --> 00:12:56,100
Yes.

275
00:12:56,420 --> 00:12:57,660
How is Yiyi's health?

276
00:12:57,860 --> 00:12:59,620
She's showing some signs of addiction,

277
00:12:59,980 --> 00:13:01,580
but it's still manageable.

278
00:13:02,220 --> 00:13:03,060
As for anything else,

279
00:13:03,300 --> 00:13:03,940
I promised her

280
00:13:03,940 --> 00:13:04,980
I wouldn't tell anyone.

281
00:13:05,140 --> 00:13:06,380
I'm her older brother.

282
00:13:06,740 --> 00:13:07,540
I'm sorry.

283
00:13:07,540 --> 00:13:08,540
I can't tell you.

284
00:13:13,220 --> 00:13:14,300
You can take my car.

285
00:13:14,380 --> 00:13:15,180
If anything comes up,

286
00:13:15,180 --> 00:13:16,220
call the hospital.

287
00:13:16,540 --> 00:13:17,900
Miss Mei and I will stay here.

288
00:13:39,980 --> 00:13:40,660
Boss Ren.

289
00:13:40,780 --> 00:13:42,620
We found these in the church restroom.

290
00:13:49,860 --> 00:13:51,220
Men's clothes

291
00:13:51,620 --> 00:13:53,060
and women's rouge.

292
00:13:54,740 --> 00:13:56,180
Have you found Lv Mengde?

293
00:13:56,500 --> 00:13:57,300
Not yet.

294
00:13:57,420 --> 00:13:59,340
But we heard something at Kaimeili.

295
00:13:59,460 --> 00:14:00,340
The woman who was shot

296
00:14:00,340 --> 00:14:01,620
appears to be an older sister

297
00:14:01,620 --> 00:14:02,740
of the girl who died, a dance hostess.

298
00:14:03,180 --> 00:14:05,260
I heard Boss Lv, the loan sharks,

299
00:14:05,260 --> 00:14:07,010
and that female tailor
are all looking for her.

300
00:14:07,830 --> 00:14:08,880
There's something else that's strange.

301
00:14:08,980 --> 00:14:09,940
Mr. Jing said

302
00:14:09,940 --> 00:14:11,740
Kuang Yijie
was attacked and hospitalized.

303
00:14:12,340 --> 00:14:14,740
Apparently,
he was robbed in the concessions.

304
00:14:16,100 --> 00:14:16,900
Robbed?

305
00:14:19,580 --> 00:14:20,940
Where is Fanshu now?

306
00:14:21,180 --> 00:14:22,220
St. Luke's Hospital.

307
00:14:30,380 --> 00:14:31,300
Mr. Jing.

308
00:14:34,620 --> 00:14:35,660
Get some rest.

309
00:14:36,140 --> 00:14:37,060
I'll keep watch.

310
00:14:40,820 --> 00:14:43,220
Thank you for everything today.

311
00:14:44,220 --> 00:14:45,620
I'm not just doing this to help you.

312
00:14:45,780 --> 00:14:46,620
I know.

313
00:14:47,260 --> 00:14:48,430
But the remaining secrets

314
00:14:49,980 --> 00:14:52,140
will have to wait until he wakes up.

315
00:14:52,740 --> 00:14:54,540
I can't tell you anything else.

316
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:57,180
That's all right.

317
00:14:58,060 --> 00:14:58,940
Mr. Jing.

318
00:15:00,780 --> 00:15:02,060
Is everything you're doing

319
00:15:03,420 --> 00:15:05,500
really just out of sympathy for Xiaozhu?

320
00:15:11,340 --> 00:15:13,580
These are reports from
Bai Mali's free medical consultations.

321
00:15:14,580 --> 00:15:16,940
She recently found
over a dozen female patients

322
00:15:17,260 --> 00:15:18,900
showing the same signs of drug exposure.

323
00:15:19,250 --> 00:15:21,340
They all had different
black cat designs on their bodies.

324
00:15:21,460 --> 00:15:22,620
I'm worried they may

325
00:15:23,420 --> 00:15:24,980
be caught up
in some kind of criminal activity.

326
00:15:25,260 --> 00:15:28,340
But Xiaozhu had no such marking.

327
00:15:30,340 --> 00:15:32,100
That's what puzzled us.

328
00:15:32,420 --> 00:15:33,660
There were similarities between them,

329
00:15:34,020 --> 00:15:35,300
but they weren't exactly the same.

330
00:15:37,660 --> 00:15:38,820
Bai Mali also discovered

331
00:15:38,980 --> 00:15:40,220
that several of them

332
00:15:40,540 --> 00:15:41,832
(List)
had attended a women's vocational school

333
00:15:41,832 --> 00:15:42,900
(List)
funded by the Cishan Foundation.

334
00:15:43,140 --> 00:15:44,420
She asked me to help investigate.

335
00:15:44,780 --> 00:15:46,180
I did try to find them.

336
00:15:46,220 --> 00:15:46,980
But I discovered

337
00:15:46,980 --> 00:15:48,100
that some had gone missing,

338
00:15:48,580 --> 00:15:50,060
while others
had provided false information.

339
00:15:50,780 --> 00:15:51,820
I couldn't locate any of them.

340
00:15:54,380 --> 00:15:56,260
Opium can be used
to force women into prostitution.

341
00:15:56,580 --> 00:15:58,500
Coca wine can be used the same way.

342
00:15:59,220 --> 00:16:01,940
I'm worried there's an organized,

343
00:16:02,140 --> 00:16:03,380
premeditated crime behind all this.

344
00:16:03,540 --> 00:16:04,700
You mean the Kun Society?

345
00:16:08,780 --> 00:16:09,580
No, wait.

346
00:16:10,380 --> 00:16:11,660
You're part of the Kun Society yourself.

347
00:16:11,660 --> 00:16:12,510
If you wanted to investigate,

348
00:16:12,510 --> 00:16:13,660
wouldn't that be easy?

349
00:16:14,020 --> 00:16:15,780
I have no say in the Kun Society.

350
00:16:16,180 --> 00:16:17,540
My parents passed away long ago.

351
00:16:17,980 --> 00:16:20,300
Luckily, Boss Ren
was an old acquaintance of my father,

352
00:16:20,460 --> 00:16:21,460
so he lent me a hand

353
00:16:21,460 --> 00:16:22,460
and helped me get established.

354
00:16:22,860 --> 00:16:24,220
I've always depended on others.

355
00:16:24,620 --> 00:16:26,380
How could I dare investigate openly?

356
00:16:26,900 --> 00:16:27,700
Miss Mei.

357
00:16:28,340 --> 00:16:30,180
If I can't uncover
the truth behind all this,

358
00:16:30,580 --> 00:16:32,940
I'm afraid
the Cishan Foundation may one day

359
00:16:32,980 --> 00:16:34,420
be falsely accused of wrongdoing.

360
00:16:35,020 --> 00:16:36,740
The only legacy my father left behind

361
00:16:36,780 --> 00:16:38,060
could be destroyed.

362
00:16:39,020 --> 00:16:40,500
That's my real reason for doing this.

363
00:16:40,980 --> 00:16:41,940
I want to uncover the truth

364
00:16:41,940 --> 00:16:43,460
about what's happening to these women.

365
00:16:43,780 --> 00:16:45,340
Who is really hurting them?

366
00:16:47,700 --> 00:16:48,500
Miss Mei.

367
00:16:49,380 --> 00:16:50,860
Will you help me investigate?

368
00:16:51,700 --> 00:16:54,740
♪And watch the lights
come on one by one♪

369
00:16:55,300 --> 00:16:58,140
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

370
00:16:58,780 --> 00:17:01,620
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

371
00:17:01,620 --> 00:17:03,540
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

372
00:17:03,540 --> 00:17:05,100
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

373
00:17:05,100 --> 00:17:07,060
♪But I refuse to fall♪

374
00:17:07,060 --> 00:17:11,980
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

375
00:17:12,100 --> 00:17:14,540
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

376
00:17:15,620 --> 00:17:18,620
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

377
00:17:18,940 --> 00:17:21,780
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

378
00:17:21,820 --> 00:17:24,620
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

379
00:17:25,340 --> 00:17:28,220
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

380
00:17:28,220 --> 00:17:31,420
♪My gaze clear, illuminating the dawn♪

381
00:17:32,900 --> 00:17:35,660
♪Those who have hurt me♪

382
00:17:36,220 --> 00:17:38,900
♪I choose to pierce through♪

383
00:17:40,500 --> 00:17:41,980
♪To tear apart♪

384
00:17:42,100 --> 00:17:47,980
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

385
00:17:49,660 --> 00:17:51,780
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

386
00:17:51,780 --> 00:17:54,700
♪Nor bow to power♪

387
00:17:54,700 --> 00:17:56,980
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

388
00:17:58,780 --> 00:18:02,700
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪
